  briefingSystemLine: 'ALERT: Simulation 03 contains unverified data.'
  briefing: 'This one wasn''t on the schedule. It was added to your queue this morning.

    The enemy data doesn''t match any training record I have access to.

    I''ve reported it. I''m told it''s within parameters.

    Just... stay sharp, 11S.'
  debriefSystemLine: 'Analysis: Simulation 03 cleared. Anomalous data: purged.'
  debrief: 'That''s all of them. Certification is complete.

    Unit No. 11 Type S, you are cleared for deployment to Earth.

    I''ll be your Operator down there, too.

    ...If that''s all right.

    Glory to Mankind.'
  failureTitle: Simulation Integrity Compromised
  failureSystemLine: 'ALERT: Connection to unit interrupted.'
  failureMessage: "11S? 11S, respond\u2014\n...Your vitals are stable. I'm pulling you out.\nResetting simulation.\n...I'm told this is within parameters."
  failureMenuLabel: '[ Reinitialize ]'
